{"4626350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lampyris Moon", "steam_appid": 4626350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lampyris Moon is a narrative psychological horror game where a strange night unfolds a disturbing story through the eyes of the person who experienced it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>Playtime: 1 hour to 1 hour 30 minutes</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Conversations with NPCs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with mysterious characters, each seemingly knowing more than they let on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their words can guide you… or mislead you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/c52973b5cb49ca3114162a9e365335e1.poster.avif?t=1778422337\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/c52973b5cb49ca3114162a9e365335e1.webm?t=1778422337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/c52973b5cb49ca3114162a9e365335e1.mp4?t=1778422337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Simple Puzzles.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles in strange environments where logic seems to have changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings carefully to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/031aa2e47f35c27519d2aa3c786325bf.poster.avif?t=1778422337\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/031aa2e47f35c27519d2aa3c786325bf.webm?t=1778422337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/031aa2e47f35c27519d2aa3c786325bf.mp4?t=1778422337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interact with the Environment.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate objects, explore unusual locations, and discover hidden elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to your presence… sometimes unpredictably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/c6efba2f80014cfa70b2cfdd7343f002.poster.avif?t=1778422337\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/c6efba2f80014cfa70b2cfdd7343f002.webm?t=1778422337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626350/extras/c6efba2f80014cfa70b2cfdd7343f002.mp4?t=1778422337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple Enemies.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face different entities that haunt this universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has its own behavior… and its own intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli